<title>UK: S&amp;P says GIE Poliet Finances A1 rating withdrawn.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P says GIE Poliet Finances A1 rating withdrawn.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's said on Wednesday it withdrew GIE Poliet Finances' A1 French commercial paper rating at the issuer's request.</p>
<p>S&amp;P said the rating was withdrawn as there would be no future drawings and there was no outstanding paper under the programme.</p>
<p>&quot;The rating was affirmed following the announcement on May 7, 1996 that Compagnie de Saint-Gobain (rated AA minus) would progressively take control of Poliet SA which it now directly refinances,&quot; S&amp;P said in a statement.</p>
</text>
